<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποικ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄποικος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>settlement far from home, colony,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				373.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>, etc.; correlative to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρόπολις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀ. στέλλειν,
			ἄγειν,</span> send, lead to form <i>a settlement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.124
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κτίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					814
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐκπέμπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κηρύσσειν ἐς τόπον</span>
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					702c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέλλειν</span>(of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκιστής</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.6.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστέλλειν</span> (of the
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρόπολις</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.176
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κώμη ἀ. οἰκίας</span> is
				<i>an offshoot from . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1252b17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>migration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.410
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>charter</i> granted to a colony, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				73
			</span></i>.</div>
